<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM Q4 net loss 286 mln guilders.</title>
<headline>KLM Q4 net loss 286 mln guilders.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q4 1996/97 to March 31.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net result			  loss 286     vs   8    profit</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (guilders)   loss 3.93  vs   0.05 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - KLM Royal Dutch Airlines previously said the fourth quarter of its financial year was traditionally weak.  </p>
<p>    Operating result		    loss 154   vs  100 loss</p>
<p>    Traffic revenue (billions)	     2.18  vs    1.90</p>
<p>    Total turnover (billions)		2.54  vs    2.24</p>
<p>    Total operating costs (billions)     2.69  vs    2.34</p>
<p>    Interest charges			  72     vs   57</p>
<p>    Profit on asset sales		   nil    vs   60</p>
<p>    Income from Northwest Airlines	63     vs   92</p>
<p>    Income from other holdings	    nil    vs    4</p>
<p>    Tax				   gain 167     vs    8 gain</p>
<p>    Preferred stock dividends		4     vs    4</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
